# The developer's global gitignore (~/.config/git/ignore) excludes *.png, *.mp3
# and friends to keep binaries out of snapshots. This site genuinely needs its
# icons and the desk's UI sounds, so re-include them here: a .gitignore inside
# the repository takes precedence over the global excludes file.
!*.png
!*.jpg
!*.jpeg
!*.webp
!*.ico
!*.mp3
!*.woff
!*.woff2
